++-+-----------+-+-------------+-+
+ ^             ^               ^
+ |             |               |
+ |             |               +------- EA bit (always 1)
+ |             +------- EA bit (always 0)
+ 1 : broadcast, multicast
+ 0 : unicast
 ]]></artwork>
